WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.200
Open the Portfolio

2
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.700
Tap + for a new project

3
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:15.200
Blank, a template — or just describe it

4
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:21.100
Say what it is, in your own words

5
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:25.100
Generate Plan — AI drafts it

6
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:28.600
A draft to review — milestones first

7
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:32.700
…then the tasks, each with a priority and a date

8
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.400
Create Project — nothing is added before you say so

9
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:48.000
The project opens with its milestones and tasks.
